    {
      "title": "1. 研究对象与任务边界",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text_template": "课题：{{/project/title}}；当前成熟度：{{/project/maturity}}。研究对象、现场边界、证据状态和适用限制以 research-record 为唯一事实源。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2. 现场问题与推荐",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "claim_ref": "/claims/CLM-001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. TRIZ 完整分析",
