    {
      "title": "7. 方案比较、选择与强反证",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text_template": "最强反对意见：{{/assessments/robustness_review/strongest_objection}}；退出条件：{{/assessments/robustness_review/exit_condition}}；移除最强支持证据后的结论：{{/assessments/robustness_review/without_strongest_support}}；说明：{{/assessments/robustness_review/rationale}}。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
